# Used by the repo-root build context (frontend-public/Dockerfile).
# Keeps the 3.9GB uploads, node_modules, build outputs and git history
# out of the Docker build context.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
.git
.claude
backend/uploads
backend/initialScript/migrate-legacy/dump
**/*.log
**/.env
!**/.env.example
